<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>50cc Scooter Monthly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>A month on a 50cc scooter in Hanoi starts from one verified number: 200,000 VND per day, the only published 50cc figure. This guide plans a monthly 50cc stay around that number honestly, because no monthly 50cc rate is published, and the monthly terms for this class come from the desk as a quote, not from an estimate.</p>
<p>We cover how a month of daily 50cc rates adds up, why every other model publishes a month and the 50cc does not, what a quoted month should be checked for, how the published monthly rates of other models anchor the comparison, and the deposit, support and licensing questions a month makes essential. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The one verified figure</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">A month at the daily rate</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Why no published 50cc month</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">Asking for a quoted month</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Published monthly rates across the fleet</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">A month of 50cc living in Hanoi</a></li>
