<p>No monthly 50cc rate is published. The verified 50cc price is 200,000 VND per day, thirty days of which would total 6,000,000 VND, so a monthly 50cc stay is quoted by the desk on request rather than estimated.</p>
</article>
<article class="faq-entry">
