<p>The entry tier, Honda Wave, Yamaha Sirius, Yamaha Mio and Honda Click, publishes 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND per month, confirmed at the counter as a range, against 1,500,000 VND for the Honda Air Blade and electric motorbike and 1,800,000 to 2,000,000 VND for the Honda Vision.</p>
</article>
<article class="faq-entry">
<h2>Can I rent a 50cc scooter for a month in Hanoi?</h2>
<p>Monthly 50cc terms are not on the published price list, so the honest answer is to contact the desk with exact dates and ask for a written quote before budgeting, comparing it against the published monthly rates of other models.</p>
